# --------------------------------------------------------
# Pimlico Paymaster (Account Abstraction & Gasless UX)
# --------------------------------------------------------
# Note: Do NOT put your Pimlico API key here! 
# Gasless transactions (like the 5k testnet Agora claim) are securely 
# routed and sponsored through Privy's Smart Wallets SDK. 
# You must configure your Pimlico Paymaster URL directly 
# inside your Privy Developer Dashboard to keep your keys safe.
